                                                "sense_id": "55a0790a-bfdb-33ba-a4b9-9921bb6275cc",
                                                "text": "In The Perfumed Garden, Nefzawi digressively but interestingly discusses, in great and curious detail, the amorous activities of animals."
                                            },
